.TH TAPMAP 1
.SH NAME
tapmap \- visualize your computer's network connections on a world map

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tapmap
.RI [ --help ]
.RI [ --version ]

.SH DESCRIPTION
TapMap visualizes your computer's network connections on an interactive
world map.

It inspects local socket activity, enriches IP addresses with local
GeoIP databases, and helps you understand network activity through a
rolling 30-day history of applications, providers, countries, and ports.

TapMap is an awareness tool. It is not a firewall or a security suite.

.SH FEATURES
.IP \(bu
Interactive world map of network connections
.IP \(bu
Local socket inspection
.IP \(bu
GeoIP-based location using local databases
.IP \(bu
Insights based on the last 30 days of activity
.IP \(bu
Daily Activity Report
.IP \(bu
Runs locally with no telemetry

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --help
Display command-line help.

.TP
.B --version
Display the application version.

.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/TapMap
Application data.

